{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-244e12", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-1b62d5"}, "note": "誤審の重みは消えず、引き受ける席が空いた分だけ裁かれる身体へ全量移ると正面から言い切って応える。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-e6bb37", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-1b62d5"}, "note": "苦悶する艦長の法廷でも重みは吊られる者の首にしかかからなかったという情景で、同じ問いへ別様に応える。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-b2913f", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "第1編が惜しむ「引き受ける席」を、苦悶は受け皿ではなく執行の油だったと切断する。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-c06181", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-17f876"}, "note": "重みに名指しで応じる者が消えたという言い切りが、では摩擦を誰の担保で戻すのかという問いを開く。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-e68361", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-17f876"}, "note": "油を失った歯車の悲鳴の出どころが移っただけだという情景から、悲鳴を聞き取る手続きの問いへ渡す。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-ea3d21", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-1b62d5"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-17f876"}, "note": "「重みはどこへ消えるのか」を閉じず、「摩擦を戻すものは何か、誰が担保するのか」へ渡す。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-a06c68", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-94d91b"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "地下の住まいを与えられた女神たち——「住所を持った誤り」という第1編の像の土台。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-bb30ec", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e822ec"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "裸の魂の審判を、衣をまとうのは裁く側だという反転として読む。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-a58921", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-916623"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "誤陽性率の格差（44.9%対23.5%）を、溝の深い側へ積もる年月として受ける。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-2ffd2e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-59ae1b"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "冗長さ・自己選好の癖を客観の一枚布で覆うという像の土台。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-fda0f9", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-4b028d"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "note": "特定階層の声だけが大きくなる増幅を、衣の下の偏りとして受ける。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-1b271b", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1f28e4"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "note": "吃音の一撃と戦時軍法会議——苦悶する艦長と夜明けの帆桁の情景の土台。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-aa01a9", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261119-b17cea"}, "note": "合計から九枚の内訳へ戻れない情景と、率から一人ひとりの顔へ戻れない言い切りが響き合う。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-4b1a43", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-87cd2d"}, "note": "先行断片は艦長の蒼ざめた唇を端末の窓口に欠けたものとして引いた。本編はその艦の夜へ戻り、唇の苦悶が重みを一度も受け止めなかったと対置する。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-1d0213", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-f70175"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-015"}, "note": "率への還元と、数から漏れた身体の年月という余り。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-9d125d", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-639862"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-71dfe0"}, "note": "裁きの席と面目——苦悶の儀礼が執行を可能にする席の作法として。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
